# PART 6 — The two things that will actually decide whether this film works

**One.** The voice. Everything else in this document is craft that a careful bot can execute. The voice is a judgement call that requires ears, and it is the variable with the largest effect on whether a judge finishes the film. Audition three, listen to all three, and spend the twenty dollars.

**Two.** The silence at "Passes: zero." Every submission's video will have wall-to-wall music. Yours will stop dead for a second and a half on the most important number in the product. That single decision will make the film feel more expensive than anything else in this document, and it costs nothing.
